# Prettier formats the code, the JSON, and the stylesheets only: its default run would also
# rewrite the Markdown, the YAML, the HTML, and pnpm-lock.yaml. Every file is ignored, then every
# directory and the code, JSON, and CSS files are let back in. Prettier also skips what .gitignore
# lists, dist/ among it.
# Adapted from spike-html-apps-foundation (d5037b4): .prettierignore, without its fixtures.
# From spike-html-hosting (cb0511c): .prettierignore.
# From spike-html-hosting-architecture (27d70e1): .prettierignore.
# Adapted from spike-html-hosting-sdk (v0.6.2): template/.prettierignore, with the copied
# wasm_exec.js, the pinned Go's own file, which lint:go checks byte for byte.
*
!*/
!*.js
!*.ts
!*.json
!*.css
web/runtime/wasm_exec.js
